From 56dc306a298405b2a0e9e15e52513434eb1a0205 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Apr 2026 19:01:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] feat(agents): add model-aware runner, bootstrap
 compaction, image pre-analysis, and failover hardening

- Add runModelAwareAgent for memory flush and followup runner
- Harden bootstrap compaction and context window budgeting
- Add image pre-analysis for non-vision models with graceful fallback
- Recognize claude-cli em-dash context overflow format
- Detect OpenAI generic 500 retry error as transient failure
- Classify bare "Internal server error" as failover-eligible timeout
- Add live session registry for embedded runner

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
